0+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"XS Poker Voice"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>My voice on another great mobile app!</p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[null,null]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Check out the video</h2>\r\n<p>I just became the XS Poker Voice. Friends of mine have developed this site and asked me to be part of it. Now I'm not a gambler but they were looking for a posh dry wit eccentric voice and I thought this fit the product. The gamble paid off and they were happy with the result.Join players from all over the world! Chat, bluff, improve your skills, win tournaments and become a poker shark! This voice is a little like my <a href=\"/minecraft-backpack-patrick-stewart-style-voiceover\" title=\"Patrick Stewart Voice\">Patrick Stewart impression</a> and I think it works really well with this video.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zaQscCLhj_Y","title":"XS Poker Voice","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/xs-poker-voice.jpg","alt":"XS Poker Voice","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>A little more about XS Poker</h2>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>XS Poker is a great little poker game for mobile that lets you practice your skills and enjoy the game without losing money. The game can't be played for money, so it isn't gambling. It's great for people who love poker but would rather not gamble on their phones. It's also great if you've just started playing poker and you'd like to get a little better at it.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you have a product or <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">promo video</a> that needs an <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>, the XS Poker voice then get in touch. To make the process even easier, just let me know the intended usage of the project and I can quote you more accurately. Feel free to send a short sample of the script and I'd be more than happy to send you a short audition to check if my voice is right for your show or project.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"XS Poker Voice","pageUrl":"xs-poker-voice"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","890",{"href":"/this-morning-spin-to-win-gameshow-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/this-morning-spin-to-win-gameshow-voice.jpg","alt":"this-morning-spin-to-win-gameshow-voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"This Morning Spin 2 Win Gameshow"}]]}],[